  "rationale": "<p>Choice B is correct. It's given that <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math> centimeters is equal to <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> meter. Therefore, <math alttext=\"2,300\"><mn>2,300</mn>\n</math> centimeters is equivalent to <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 2,300 centimeters right parenthesis left parenthesis StartFraction 1 meter Over 100 centimeters EndFraction right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2,300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>centimeters</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>meter</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>centimeters</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"23\"><mn>23</mn>\n</math> meters.</p>\n<p>Choice A is incorrect. <math alttext=\"0.043\"><mn>0.043</mn>\n</math> meters is equivalent to <math alttext=\"4.3\"><mn>4.3</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"2,300\"><mn>2,300</mn>\n</math>, centimeters.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect. <math alttext=\"2,400\"><mn>2,400</mn>\n</math> meters is equivalent to <math alttext=\"240,000\"><mn>240,000</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"2,300\"><mn>2,300</mn>\n</math>, centimeters.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect. <math alttext=\"230,000\"><mn>230,000</mn>\n</math> meters is equivalent to <math alttext=\"23,000,000\"><mn>23,000,000</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"2,300\"><mn>2,300</mn>\n</math>, centimeters.</p>",
